    "replicate_note": "k buys down a symmetric, unbiased per-cell error. Because the error is symmetric it cannot move delta-hat, only dilute power, and the dilution it causes is far smaller than the power the same call budget buys as extra anchors. k does NOT address the one failure mode that would invalidate the design -- a systematic difference in call ORDER or server state between the two arms, which is a bias and must be removed by interleaving the arms, not by replication.",
